@node Setting Metadata
@subsection Setting Metadata
@cindex issue metadata
@kindex C-c C-a

Press @kbd{C-c C-a} for the metadata sidebar:

@table @kbd
@kindex t
@item t
Type (bug, feature, task, epic, chore, @dots{}).
@kindex p
@item p
Priority (0--4).
@kindex a
@item a
Assignee.
@kindex l
@item l
Labels (comma-separated).
@kindex P
@item P
Parent issue.
@end table

Press @kbd{q} to dismiss it and return to editing.

@node Submitting and Canceling
@subsection Submitting and Canceling
@cindex submitting an issue
@kindex C-c C-c
@kindex C-c C-k

@kbd{C-c C-c} submits; the title is required and the description is
optional.  On success the buffer is killed and open lists are refreshed.
@kbd{C-c C-k} cancels; you are asked to confirm if there are unsaved
changes.

